      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi, ALL\n\nIt seems that this change caused the following 2 testcases of vts_ltp_test_arm failed:\n\n    syscalls.rt_sigaction01_32bit.syscalls.rt_sigaction01_32bit — FAIL\n        binary returned non-zero. Exit code: 135, stderr: Bus error \n    syscalls.rt_sigsuspend01_32bit.syscalls.rt_sigsuspend01_32bit — FAIL\n        binary returned non-zero. Exit code: 2, stderr: external/ltp/lib/tst_test.c:1217: INFO: Timeout per run is 0h 05m 00s\n        external/ltp/lib/tst_test.c:1262: BROK: Test killed by SIGBUS!\n\nLike reported here:\nhttps://qa-reports.linaro.org/android-lkft/5.4-gki-aosp-master-hikey960/build/5.4.75-6ee71137b820/testrun/3403190/suite/vts-test$armeabi-v7a.vts_ltp_test_arm/tests/\n\nbut I am not sure why there is no such failures reported by the android-mainline kernel which has this change as well. maybe we need to cherry-pick some other changes from the android-mainline branch as well.\n\nNot sure if anybody here has any idea about the failures reported. \n\nThanks,\nYongqin Liu\n",
      "revId": "ee753b7d136d7ac274743983af33b4e5f799d7b4",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
