      "writtenOn": "2020-11-10T19:25:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Upstream has a bunch of other vdso changes as well. For example, your series here might help fix the issue:\n\nhttps://lore.kernel.org/linux-arm-kernel/20200626132131.GA9750@willie-the-truck/\n\nIn particular this removes the sigreturn: \"arm64: compat: Remove 32-bit sigreturn code from the vDSO\". So I\u0027m backporting these changes into 4.19 to see if it has an impact on the LTP test.",
      "parentUuid": "c440cc6e_b2463f05",
      "revId": "ee753b7d136d7ac274743983af33b4e5f799d7b4",
